# Welcome

Purpose: a human start of session — greeting, date, org pulse, and
"where to go". Exists because a wall of instruments has no entry
point; this is the canvas's handshake, especially for new members.

Size/position: drag + resize on the canvas (dnd), never in the menu.
Relevancy: 🔥 core · ⭐ valuable · 💤 later

| Option | Category | Relevancy | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| variant | layout | ⭐ | hero banner / orientation card | |
| title | display | — | n/a — greeting is generated | time-aware |
| date | display | 💤 | on / off | |
| org pulse | display | ⭐ | on / off | members + events line |
| quick links | display | ⭐ | off / curated list | overlaps Shortcuts widget |
| tip line | display | 💤 | on / off | "edit in settings" hint |
| filters | filter | — | none — inherently personal+global | |
